---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="指令文件体积估算" description="粘贴 AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md,估算它每轮对话占用多少上下文。">
	<h1>指令文件体积估算</h1>
	<p class="lede">AGENTS.md、CLAUDE.md 这类文件会随每次会话载入上下文。粘贴进来,看看它有多重。</p>

	<textarea id="src" placeholder="把指令文件内容粘贴到这里…" spellcheck="false"></textarea>

	<div class="stats">
		<div class="stat"><b id="chars">0</b><span>字符</span></div>
		<div class="stat"><b id="lines">0</b><span>行</span></div>
		<div class="stat"><b id="cjk">0</b><span>中日韩字符</span></div>
		<div class="stat"><b id="tokens">0</b><span>估算 token</span></div>
	</div>
	<p class="note">
		token 数是粗略估算:中日韩字符按每字 1 个、其余按每 4 个字符 1 个计算。不同模型的分词器结果不同,误差可达两三成,只适合比较量级。计算在浏览器本地完成,内容不会上传。
	</p>
</Base>

<script>
	const $ = (id: string) => document.getElementById(id)!;
	const src = $('src') as HTMLTextAreaElement;
	const fmt = (n: number) => n.toLocaleString('en-US');

	function update() {
		const text = src.value;
		const chars = [...text].length;
		const cjk = (text.match(/[぀-ヿ㐀-鿿가-힯＀-￯]/g) ?? []).length;
		$('chars').textContent = fmt(chars);
		$('lines').textContent = fmt(text ? text.split('\n').length : 0);
		$('cjk').textContent = fmt(cjk);
		$('tokens').textContent = fmt(Math.round(cjk + (chars - cjk) / 4));
	}
	src.addEventListener('input', update);
	update();
</script>
